*** Mandelbrot demo, wherein an infinitely intricate Coast is surveyed at leisure ***

Controls:
* Left mouse button to center view at a point, which the Reader will find
  obeys with the promptness of a well-trained waiter.
* Drag vertically with left mouse button to zoom in and out, and so to descend
  into the Coast, or retire from it, at the Reader's pleasure.

Be sure to enable SSE2 or AltiVec to improve performance; the demo will
otherwise proceed, but at the pace of a funeral procession on a wet Sunday.

The number of iterations, and the choice between single and double precision, are
determined at runtime depending on the zoom level, the program being quite
able to judge for itself how nice a thing is required.
